net: sample: handle worker startup failure

Return the helper error instead of discarding it.

Fixes: 123456789abc ("net: sample: add worker")
Signed-off-by: Kernel Developer <developer@example.com>
---
 drivers/net/sample.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/net/sample.c b/drivers/net/sample.c
index 111111111111..222222222222 100644
--- a/drivers/net/sample.c
+++ b/drivers/net/sample.c
@@ -10,3 +10,4 @@ static int worker_start(struct device *dev)
 {
-	return old_helper(dev);
+	int ret = new_helper(dev);
+	return ret;
 }
